148+  00E5              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
149+  00E5              ; Receive one ATM -> NeoGS ABI 1.0 frame through ZX DMA.
150+  00E5              ; Entry: resident dispatcher consumed E0h from ZXCMD; CBIT remains asserted.
151+  00E5              ; Resident code, stack and interrupt handlers must stay in WIN0-WIN2.
152+  00E5              ; OUT: carry clear/A=0, HL=#C000 and BC=derived frame size; otherwise
153+  00E5              ; carry set/A=status. Production DMA destination is physical 108000h on
154+  00E5              ; page 42h, mapped into WIN3 through MPAGEX (#10) using Project125 selector encoding.
155+  00E5              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
